---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Remove a registered MCP server

Usage: bento mcp rm [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>
          Server name

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Enable debug logging: each smolvm call, and SMOLBENTO_LOG at info unless set

  -f, --force
          Accepted as in sbx; smolbento never asks before removing a server

      --no-input
          Never prompt; commands that need an answer fail with the command to run instead

  -h, --help
          Print help
